Option Strict On

' <summary>
' Strings of the operator's "Get connection string" action (ticket 187 T-2): the words of ExchangeConnectionStringText.
' The viewer's button this string is pasted into is "Add from an exchange server.." (ticket 187 T-4); its name here is
' the same words in each language. The product NAME is never in this table. House style: ".." for an ellipsis, a plain
' hyphen, ё in Russian. Words that already exist in the Share Manager's tables ("Закрыть", "Показать QR-код") are used
' from there.
'
' Columns after the Russian key: en, uk, de, it, es, fr, pt, ar, hi, bn, ur, zh.
' Никогда не ставьте «умные» кавычки в литерал - VB считает U+201C/U+201D разделителями
' строки; используются «…» и 「…」.
' </summary>
